<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-10T18:01:23.604Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 18:01:23 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits and ISWAP militants continue to launch coordinated attacks across northern Nigeria, targeting civilians, soldiers and Christian communities in states such as Plateau, Adamawa, Kebbi and Katsina, while police and army units conduct rescues and kill suspects, including the reported death of bandit leader Kachalla Bello in Katsina and the recovery of weapons after operations in Adamawa and Oyo. Kidnappings persist, with children and families abducted in Kaduna, Sokoto and other areas, and police have rescued a six-year-old boy in Kaduna. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOb2xYNnBaTFZmOEc1UFZvR0tnV2RHUnJ2WGNCZ3VqU2VBMzNOaEktZjhUcF9XNlNaNDIydk9ZbU5zQnJhSGdhQ05ib1dHME50Qm9HeGhTWHJHYXpacm45QlZMaE5XVmF1LUJld3NIWnJwOEhKclNrOENTQTN0TDBXLWFrSzQ0RXM1cVhiWnprQ1hzNHVCLWhxN05OaG5vRW14ODhYVTZ4MDlVOWM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxOWmpKZnJ4aXFqdXIzZFp1NjNEVDZsVVlDaDY0RnAwM2d3aXRodlpXelBrSW54dUlkSXRBanVqVTZUc2xlLVlibmdGSzBCckd5VFh5T2hPUGlRX2pzY2Q2UnpqR1RRU3kxbXlzdUZJSGZQR0VvbDk0MlUtX3dHc2RpNWMtM3BvaTR4b1FoR3RBVDNkZ3VRbUVTQ21kRExEM3pOdnB5ZnJZbHNEMTV2?oc=5&quot;&gt;Truth Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxOc1JoOHJBeFZlRjJacktESFRwajFzaDViWndYd3VmT012czN0MzN0TnBaOUEwTjRFTlZhdUhhX0FWRVVaLVFrWmhCZmhqaUcwU0k3cVhJekZNNWRDQ1ZRS05MTjBpMmQ0dllfM0xacFJkZlJjLXJtQUdJSjNuVC1UTjNEbm9rSVJCOFJPTmVKM3Q0LXZlaEMtbEl1dE95VXNjQmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Post Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiU0FVX3lxTE03OTVXTi1uVXYtcDYtcXNxbDlSaVV0X1RVLWpLSEx6cVRNVk5XYjNYZndQWVNya1BWQmR2MlZZclVSZktSRUR6LWhfNnI5ZzhUaXEw?oc=5&quot;&gt;شبكة تواصل الإخبارية&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;h